  "projectDescription": "A Flutter plugin for native video playback on iOS and Android using AVPlayer and ExoPlayer, with HLS streaming, DRM, Chromecast, AirPlay, Picture-in-Picture, background playback, subtitles, offline downloads, and performance tuning for multi-video feeds.",
