  "keyFeatures": [
    "Native AVPlayer (iOS) and ExoPlayer/Media3 (Android) integration",
    "HLS adaptive streaming with quality selection and viewport-based capping",
    "DRM support: FairPlay (iOS), Widevine (Android), AES-128, ClearKey",
    "Picture-in-Picture on both platforms with automatic state management",
    "AirPlay support with device availability and connection tracking",
    "Chromecast: pure-Dart device discovery and full cast session control",
    "Offline video downloads with progress streams and local playback",
    "Sidecar subtitles (VTT/SRT) with fully styleable Flutter overlay",
    "Embedded HLS subtitle tracks with native text-size scaling",
    "Audio track selection across alternate renditions",
    "Background playback with Now Playing / media notifications",
    "Texture rendering mode (experimental) for scroll-feed performance",
    "Disk cache and precache for Android (Media3 LRU cache)",
    "Resume positions, A-B loop/clip ranges, and playlist auto-advance",
    "Playback analytics: startup time, stalls, watched duration, quality switches",
    "NativeVideoPlayerConfig global performance tuning knobs",
    "Scrub-preview storyboards (WebVTT and sprite-sheet grids)",
    "WASM compatible"
  ],
